                    "[qual-depend] [col-idx] The claim that an `Int` is a **valid index of one",
                    "particular list**: `0 <= index < size(list)`, bound to that list's",
                    "identity, so `Idx(xs) Int` and `Idx(ys) Int` are different facts. Tested",
